        "execution_input": {
          "flat_skill_context": "### Selected skill 1: skill_heat_then_place\n\n# Heat an object, then place it\n\n**Task family:** `pick_heat_then_place_in_recep`\n\n## Purpose\n\nHeat one named object in a microwave before placing it at its destination.\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Identify the object, microwave, and destination.\n2. Locate and take the object, opening containers only as required.\n3. Navigate to the microwave. Open it before inserting the object.\n4. Put the object in the microwave, close the microwave, and invoke the\n   environment's heating action.\n5. Reopen the microwave, take the heated object, and place it at the requested\n   destination.\n6. Stop when task feedback indicates success.\n\n## When to use\n\nUse when the instruction says to heat, warm, or microwave an object before\nplacing it elsewhere.\n\n## Common failure modes\n\n- Heating is attempted while the object is not inside the microwave.\n- The microwave is left open when the environment requires it to be closed.\n- The agent forgets to retrieve the heated object after heating.\n- The object is delivered to the destination before the heating step.\n",
          "selected_native_skills": [
            "# Heat an object, then place it\n\n**Task family:** `pick_heat_then_place_in_recep`\n\n## Purpose\n\nHeat one named object in a microwave before placing it at its destination.\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Identify the object, microwave, and destination.\n2. Locate and take the object, opening containers only as required.\n3. Navigate to the microwave. Open it before inserting the object.\n4. Put the object in the microwave, close the microwave, and invoke the\n   environment's heating action.\n5. Reopen the microwave, take the heated object, and place it at the requested\n   destination.\n6. Stop when task feedback indicates success.\n\n## When to use\n\nUse when the instruction says to heat, warm, or microwave an object before\nplacing it elsewhere.\n\n## Common failure modes\n\n- Heating is attempted while the object is not inside the microwave.\n- The microwave is left open when the environment requires it to be closed.\n- The agent forgets to retrieve the heated object after heating.\n- The object is delivered to the destination before the heating step.\n"
